desc:
1 bedroom 1 bath semi-basement suite with separate entrance in a beautiful neighbourhood in Deep Cove. Living room, kitchen and laundry suite on ground level, bedroom with a window on basement level. 

Features:
1- one dedicated back lane parking lot, and street parking in the front;
2- private laundry set within the suite;
3- full kitchen with oven, stove and fridge;
4- queen size bed with foam mattress;
5- newly installed dual-system heat pump offering ambient heating and cooling during the seasons
6- bus stop across the street, direct access to Capilano Uni. and DT Vancouver, or more routes at Phibbs Exchange
7- 10-15 mins walk to local beaches, grocery store, Parkgate Center, library, restaurants, Deep Cove village and more parks. Locally beloved Il Corvo is just around the corner.
8- Seperate entrance

Rent includes all utilities (high-speed fibre WiFi, gas, water and electricity), and furnitures in the attached picture (I realize I didn't take a photo for the couch or the laundry set). min. 1-year lease, no sublet, no smoking or vaping or marijuna, family friendly and respect to the neighbourhood welcome. If you are interested, please send over a brief introduction of yourself and why you are looking for a place in the North Shore.
